<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/50701f538716d5e1f35b123392789d9a28b30cdced2fcd9e59de65411dc1d349> a loroc:RegulatedConduct ;
    skos:inScheme loroc:conductScheme ;
